{
  "id": "picker",
  "name": "日期、时间、地址",
  "nav": "日期、时间、地址",
  "en": "DatePicker · TimePicker · RegionPicker",
  "group": "表单",
  "specRef": "",
  "summary": "触发框和下拉选择同一个样子，面板和菜单同一种开合。日历换月时网格往所去的方向滑，点标题切到月份；时间两列滚动吸附到中间的选中带；地址按省、市、区三级走，选完一级自动滑到下一级，也可以跨级搜索。有值时悬停，右边的图标换成清除。",
  "acceptance": [
    "日历一格 36px、圆 32px；今天在数字下面一个小点；范围内铺一条连续的浅色带，起止两天是实心圆。周一开头。",
    "键盘：方向键按天 / 周移动，PageUp / PageDown 换月，Home / End 到周一 / 周日，回车选中，Esc 收起并把焦点还给触发框。时间列：上下键一格、翻页键五格。",
    "定时发布早于现在时\"确定\"不可点，原因写在面板底部，不弹提示。地址的直辖市只写一次（\"北京市 / 东城区\"）。"
  ],
  "api": [
    {
      "title": "bindPickers(root, 选项)",
      "head": [
        "选项 / 事件",
        "说明"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "today / now",
          "今天、现在（默认真实时间；设计稿里固定成 2026-11-19 15:42）"
        ],
        [
          "pick 事件",
          "值变了在宿主上冒泡，detail: { text }"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "标记",
      "head": [
        "写法",
        "说明"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "data-pk=\"date\"",
          "日期：换月时网格往所去方向滑；点标题切月份视图；键盘按天 / 周 / 月走"
        ],
        [
          "data-pk=\"range\"",
          "日期范围：两个月并排、左边快捷预设；窄屏换成上下叠"
        ],
        [
          "data-pk=\"time\"",
          "时间：时、分两列，滚动吸附到中间的选中带"
        ],
        [
          "data-pk=\"datetime\"",
          "定时发布：日历 + 时间；早于现在的不能确定"
        ],
        [
          "data-pk=\"region\"",
          "地址：省 → 市 → 区三级，可跨级搜索"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
  "usage": {
    "css": [
      "form.css",
      "picker.css"
    ],
    "api": [
      [
        "bindPickers(root, { today, now })",
        "satin-ui/components"
      ]
    ]
  },
  "example": {
    "0": {
      "js": "import { setup } from \"satin-ui\";\nimport { bindPickers } from \"satin-ui/components\";\nimport \"satin-ui/css/picker.css\";\n\nsetup(); // 页面级行为（Esc、点外面关上），整页调一次\n\n// 写了 data-pk 的都接上：date（日期）| range（范围，两个月并排、快捷预设）| time（时、分两列）\n//                       | datetime（定时发布：日历 + 时间）| region（省 / 市 / 区，可跨级搜索）\nbindPickers(document);\n\ndocument.addEventListener(\"pick\", (e) => {\n  console.log(e.target.dataset.pk, e.detail.text); // 比如 \"date\"、\"11 月 21 日 星期六\"\n});"
    }
  },
  "demos": [
    {
      "caption": "",
      "html": "<div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <div class=\"sn-field\"><span class=\"sn-lbl\">交付日期</span>\n        <div class=\"sn-pk\" data-pk=\"date\"><button class=\"sn-pk-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"sn-val sn-ph\" data-ph=\"选择日期\">选择日期</span><span class=\"sn-end sn-swap\"><span class=\"sn-a\" data-i=\"calendar\"></span><span class=\"sn-b\" data-i=\"x\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"清除\"></span></span></button>\n          <div class=\"sn-pk-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择日期\"><div class=\"cal-slot\"></div><div class=\"sn-pk-foot\"><button class=\"sn-btn sn-ghost sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-today>今天</button><span class=\"sn-grow\"></span><button class=\"sn-btn sn-ghost sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-clear>清除</button></div></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sn-field\"><span class=\"sn-lbl\">统计范围</span>\n        <div class=\"sn-pk\" data-pk=\"range\" style=\"min-width:260px\"><button class=\"sn-pk-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"sn-val sn-ph\" data-ph=\"选择开始和结束日期\">选择开始和结束日期</span><span class=\"sn-end sn-swap\"><span class=\"sn-a\" data-i=\"calendar\"></span><span class=\"sn-b\" data-i=\"x\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"清除\"></span></span></button>\n          <div class=\"sn-pk-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择日期范围\"><div class=\"sn-pk-range\"><div class=\"sn-pk-presets\"><button type=\"button\" data-p=\"today\">今天</button><button type=\"button\" data-p=\"d7\">最近 7 天</button><button type=\"button\" data-p=\"d30\">最近 30 天</button><button type=\"button\" data-p=\"month\">本月</button><button type=\"button\" data-p=\"last\">上个月</button></div><div class=\"cal-slot\"></div></div>\n            <div class=\"sn-pk-foot\"><button class=\"sn-btn sn-ghost sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-reset>重置</button><span class=\"sn-note\"></span><span class=\"sn-grow\"></span><button class=\"sn-btn sn-primary sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-ok>确定</button></div></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sn-field\"><span class=\"sn-lbl\">每天提醒</span>\n        <div class=\"sn-pk\" data-pk=\"time\" style=\"min-width:140px\"><button class=\"sn-pk-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"sn-val sn-ph\" data-ph=\"选择时间\">选择时间</span><span class=\"sn-end sn-swap\"><span class=\"sn-a\" data-i=\"clock\"></span><span class=\"sn-b\" data-i=\"x\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"清除\"></span></span></button>\n          <div class=\"sn-pk-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择时间\"><div class=\"tc-slot\"></div><div class=\"sn-pk-foot\"><button class=\"sn-btn sn-ghost sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-now>此刻</button><span class=\"sn-grow\"></span><button class=\"sn-btn sn-primary sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-ok>确定</button></div></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sn-field\"><span class=\"sn-lbl\">定时发布</span>\n        <div class=\"sn-pk\" data-pk=\"datetime\" style=\"min-width:250px\"><button class=\"sn-pk-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"sn-val sn-ph\" data-ph=\"选择发布时间\">选择发布时间</span><span class=\"sn-end sn-swap\"><span class=\"sn-a\" data-i=\"calendar\"></span><span class=\"sn-b\" data-i=\"x\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"清除\"></span></span></button>\n          <div class=\"sn-pk-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择发布时间\"><div class=\"sn-pk-dt\"><div class=\"cal-slot\"></div><div class=\"sn-tside\"><span class=\"sn-cap\">时间</span><div class=\"tc-slot\"></div></div></div>\n            <div class=\"sn-pk-foot\"><span class=\"sn-note\"></span><span class=\"sn-grow\"></span><button class=\"sn-btn sn-primary sn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-ok>确定</button></div></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"sn-field\"><span class=\"sn-lbl\">寄送地址</span>\n        <div class=\"sn-pk\" data-pk=\"region\" style=\"min-width:250px\"><button class=\"sn-pk-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><span class=\"sn-val sn-ph\" data-ph=\"选择省 / 市 / 区\">选择省 / 市 / 区</span><span class=\"sn-end sn-swap\"><span class=\"sn-a\" data-i=\"map-pin\"></span><span class=\"sn-b\" data-i=\"x\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"清除\"></span></span></button>\n          <div class=\"sn-pk-panel sn-rg\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择地址\"><div class=\"rg-search\"><input class=\"sn-input sn-sm\" type=\"text\" enterkeyhint=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索省、市、区，比如：西湖\" aria-label=\"搜索地址\"></div>\n            <div class=\"sn-rg-hot\">常用<button type=\"button\" data-path=\"北京市/北京市\">北京</button><button type=\"button\" data-path=\"上海市/上海市\">上海</button><button type=\"button\" data-path=\"广东省/广州市\">广州</button><button type=\"button\" data-path=\"广东省/深圳市\">深圳</button><button type=\"button\" data-path=\"浙江省/杭州市\">杭州</button><button type=\"button\" data-path=\"四川省/成都市\">成都</button></div>\n            <div class=\"sn-rg-tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><span class=\"sn-ink\"></span></div><div class=\"sn-rg-vp\"><div class=\"sn-rg-res sn-sa-vp sn-fy\" role=\"listbox\" hidden></div></div></div></div></div>\n    </div>"
    }
